(* The terms defined in this file cannot be extracted by hax at the
   moment, thus we provide them here.

   Under the uniform-bitstring ProVerif backend, every Rust type
   collapses to ProVerif's [bitstring], so we no longer declare per-
   Rust-type ProVerif type names. The standard `rust_primitives::*`,
   `core::*`, `rand_core::*`, and `hax_lib::*` symbols are already
   declared by hax's shipped `primitives.pvl`, which
   `hax-driver.py typecheck-proverif` loads automatically. As of the
   uniform-bitstring migration this file is empty — left in place so
   future bertie-specific overrides have a home. *)
